  "intro": "When you buy a new car, truck or motorcycle, motor dealers will often organise the registration for you. If this is not the case, you can register the vehicle yourself at a Service NSW Centre.\n\nYou can also visit a service centre to register a trailer or caravan.\n\nNote: If there's no record of you with Transport for NSW (TfNSW), you'll need to set up your customer number or driver licence number first.",
  "who_can_apply": [
    "Must be able to visit a Service NSW Centre to register the vehicle.",
    "If no record exists with Transport for NSW (TfNSW), the customer must set up a customer number or driver licence number first."
  ],
